  ],
  "correct_answer": [
    "A"
  ],
  "solution": {
    "text": "<img src=\"assets\\st0017_6b1483e90fa1.png\"><br />$\\begin{aligned} & \\frac{1}{\\lambda}=\\mathrm{Rz}^2\\left(\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}_1^2}-\\frac{1}{\\mathrm{n}_2^2}\\right) \\\\ & \\frac{\\frac{1}{\\lambda_{\\mathrm{L}}}=\\mathrm{Rz}^2\\left(\\frac{1}{1^2}\\right)}{\\frac{1}{\\lambda_{\\mathrm{B}}}=\\mathrm{Rz}^2\\left(\\frac{1}{2^2}\\right)} \\\\ & \\frac{\\lambda_{\\mathrm{B}}}{\\lambda_{\\mathrm{L}}}=4: 1\\end{aligned}$"
